  itemId: block_serverrack
  displayName: Server Controller
  description: The brain of the mass-storage network - exactly ONE per system. Holds
    up to 4 RAM modules (pattern slots) and 1 CPU (craft speed). Disks live in NAS
    shelves and PSUs in Power Stations; connect everything with Data Pipes or by
    touching blocks. Two controllers on one network conflict and the whole system
    goes dark.
